# Calibration standards are INPUTS, not outputs: the coefficients in methods/*.yaml
# cannot be re-derived without them. The 260810 curve was recovered from a KakaoTalk
# download folder on 260906 after its r2 sat as `null` for weeks.
!methods/standards/*.xlsx
